# Waivers of the coverage check of the benchmark cases (`bench/bench cases --check`), one line each: KEY<TAB>reason
#   commit SHA<TAB>reason     a landed commit that states a speed and has no CHANGELOG line (SHA: the first 7 or more characters of the hash)
#   figure PHRASE<TAB>reason  a CHANGELOG line that states a figure and has no row in bench/claims.tsv yet
#   PHRASE<TAB>reason         a CHANGELOG line that no case measures
# A waiver that matches nothing is a warning: remove it when its release is tagged. Every waiver of a tagged release is gone from this file.
